# Which benchmarks to run for a new model

Delivery root of the paper. Layout (owner in `.forgejo/CODEOWNERS`):

- `paper/` LaTeX sources of the paper (`main.tex`, sections, appendix, checklist); the document is built by the system from `paper/main.tex`.
- `venue/` the venue's official template files and checklist template.
- `refs/` the verified bibliography (`refs.bib`).
- `figtab/` figures and table fragments the paper includes, with their generating scripts and provenance sidecars.
- `code/` all analysis code and the reproduction notes (`code/README.md`: environment, data versions, seeds, commands, run times, which script makes each table and figure).
- `results/` the result files the figures, tables and numbers of the paper are computed from.
